        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SSP2410, 24 Inch Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 24 Inch Contemporary Pull can be used in commercial as well as residential applications. It is made out of durable stainless steel and is available in brushed stainless, polished stainless, or black finishes. This 2 foot door pull comes packaged with the mounting hardware for wood, fiberglass, metal, or glass doors. It is modern and sexy--the perfect finishing touch for any home or office door.\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SSP2410-specifications.gif?v=1704354607\" width=\"600\" height=\"175\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" atl=\"Deltana SSP2410 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available <a href=\"/products/back-to-back-24-inch-contemporary-pulls-pair-deltana-sspbb2410\"><b>Deltana SSPBB2410 Contemporary 24\" Back-to-Back Pulls</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana Square Stainless Steel Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 25\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Length: 1\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 2-1/4\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for glass, fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SSP2410-specifciations.pdf?v=1704262342\"><b>Deltana SSP2410 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
